  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1609.03 Changes in Steps",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1609.03 Changes in Steps.\n\n(a) To obtain a step increase, a principal operator or assistant operator shall submit proof of continuing professional development with the application for renewal as specified in Env-Sw 1611.\n\n(b) A change in an individual’s step designation shall be effective upon renewal of the individual’s certification.\n\nSource. #10600, eff 7-1-14; ss by #12045, eff 11-18-16; ss by #13623, eff 5-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw1600.html"
